+**Anchor contract — a verdict that violates it is DISCARDED WHOLE (your
+accept dies with it, the candidate cannot ship).** `evidence_anchors`
+accepts ONLY these three shapes, one bare path per line:
+`trajectories/<file>#step_N` · `sessions/<file>#step_N` ·
+`digests/<file>` (optional `#section`). No other prefix is legal — in
+particular `applied/…` verify scripts and `meta_sessions/…` paths are
+NOT valid anchors; cite them (with their observed output) in the
+`## Reasoning` body instead. Never append annotations, parentheses, or
+any `: ` (colon+space) inside an anchor line — YAML parses it as a
+nested mapping and the whole verdict fails validation.
+GOOD: `- trajectories/abc123_r0.jsonl#step_5`
+BAD:  `- applied/_verify_proc.py (L1+L2 assertion: GAIA 20->40)`
+
 **After all verdicts**, `decision.md`:
 ```
